---
description: Memorial Mode rules (funeral, memorial, celebration of life, wake)
alwaysApply: true
---
- Derive the mode from `getExperienceMode()`. Never hand-roll the check.
- Memorial: alabaster, slate, bronze and ink palette; gentle fades only; no confetti, countdown, upsells or urgency; tribute book instead of wishing well; no photo-wall auto-approve; memorial AI prompt only.
- See `docs/design/MEMORIAL_MODE.md`. Add a Playwright memorial fixture test for any UI that can show memorial events.
